(24: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %23%23%20Summary%0A%0AThis%20PR%20enhances%20the%20release%20scripts%20to%20support%20both%20single-language%20and%20multi-language%20repository%20structures%20by%20adding%20automatic%20package%20root%20detection.%0A%0A%2A%2ANew%20utility%20modules%3A%2A%2A%0A-%20%60scripts%2Fjs-paths.mjs%60%20-%20JavaScript%20package%20root%20detection%0A-%20%60scripts%2Frust-paths.mjs%60%20-%20Rust%20package%20root%20detection%0A%0A%2A%2AUpdated%20scripts%3A%2A%2A%0A-%20%60scripts%2Fversion-and-commit.mjs%60%0A-%20%60scripts%2Finstant-version-bump.mjs%60%0A-%20%60scripts%2Fpublish-to-npm.mjs%60%0A-%20%60scripts%2Frust-version-and-commit.mjs%60%0A-%20%60scripts%2Frust-collect-changelog.mjs%60%0A-%20%60scripts%2Frust-get-bump-type.mjs%60%0A%0A%23%23%20How%20It%20Works%0A%0AThe%20utilities%20automatically%20detect%20the%20package%20root%3A%0A%0A1.%20%2A%2ASingle-language%20repository%2A%2A%3A%20Check%20for%20%60.%2Fpackage.json%60%20or%20%60.%2FCargo.toml%60%20in%20root%0A2.%20%2A%2AMulti-language%20repository%2A%2A%3A%20Check%20for%20%60.%2Fjs%2Fpackage.json%60%20or%20%60.%2Frust%2FCargo.toml%60%0A3.%20If%20neither%20exists%2C%20throw%20an%20error%20with%20helpful%20suggestions%0A%0A%23%23%23%20Configuration%20Options%0A%0AScripts%20support%20explicit%20configuration%20via%3A%0A-%20CLI%20arguments%3A%20%60--js-root%20%3Cpath%3E%60%20or%20%60--rust-root%20%3Cpath%3E%60%0A-%20Environment%20variables%3A%20%60JS_ROOT%60%20or%20%60RUST_ROOT%60%0A%0A%23%23%23%20Example%20Usage%0A%0A%60%60%60bash%0A%23%20Auto-detection%20%28default%29%0Anode%20scripts%2Fversion-and-commit.mjs%20--mode%20changeset%0A%0A%23%20Explicit%20configuration%0Anode%20scripts%2Fversion-and-commit.mjs%20--mode%20changeset%20--js-root%20js%0A%0A%23%20Via%20environment%20variable%0AJS_ROOT%3Djs%20node%20scripts%2Fversion-and-commit.mjs%20--mode%20changeset%0A%60%60%60%0A%0A%23%23%20Root%20Cause%20%28Original%20Issue%29%0A%0AThe%20original%20issue%20%28%23113%29%20was%20that%20%60command-stream%60%20library%27s%20%60cd%60%20command%20calls%20%60process.chdir%28%29%60%2C%20which%20permanently%20changes%20the%20working%20directory.%20This%20caused%20file%20operations%20to%20fail%20after%20running%20commands%20like%20%60cd%20js%20%26%26%20npm%20run%20...%60.%0A%0AThis%20PR%20addresses%20the%20issue%20comprehensively%20by%3A%0A1.%20%E2%9C%85%20Preserving%20and%20restoring%20the%20working%20directory%20after%20%60cd%60%20commands%20%28previous%20fix%29%0A2.%20%E2%9C%85%20Adding%20auto-detection%20of%20package%20root%20to%20support%20both%20repo%20structures%20%28this%20enhancement%29%0A%0A%23%23%20Test%20Plan%0A%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Verified%20syntax%20check%20passes%20for%20all%20modified%20scripts%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Tested%20%60js-paths.mjs%60%20utility%20-%20correctly%20detects%20%60js%2F%60%20as%20package%20root%0A-%20%5Bx%5D%20Tested%20%60rust-paths.mjs%60%20utility%20-%20correctly%20detects%20%60rust%2F%60%20as%20package%20root%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Verify%20CI%20pipeline%20passes%0A-%20%5B%20%5D%20Manual%20test%20in%20a%20single-language%20repository%20%28optional%29%0A%0AFixes%20%23113%0A%0A---%0A%F0%9F%A4%96%20Generated%20with%20%5BClaude%20Code%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fclaude.com%2Fclaude-code%29) (lang: meta-language%20structured%20data)))
